# Sent to the daemon as build context, so keep it to what the image actually needs.
**/node_modules
**/target
**/out
**/.git
**/.bsp
**/.bloop
**/.metals

# Generated mirrors, rebuilt inside the image from the named build contexts rather than copied in.
# Matched by shape rather than by this application's resource directory name, so the three
# .dockerignore files stay identical.
**/website-static/vendor/taxpert/
